B.aXO=new A.lq(B.n6,"Who can see my job and the bids?","Mechanics nearby see your job description, vehicle, photos and zip code. Only you see the bids \u2014 mechanics can't see each other's prices.")
B.zI=new A.aw(61296,"MaterialIcons",null,!1)
B.aXV=new A.lq(B.zI,"How do I choose a bid?","Compare price, the day and time each mechanic can arrive, and their profile and ratings. There's no rush \u2014 pick the one you're comfortable with.")
B.aXT=new A.lq(B.hg,"What does the mechanic see about me?","Very little. Your address is shown only to the mechanic you choose, and only after your payment is secured. Other personal details stay private until they arrive.")
B.aXQ=new A.lq(B.n5,"How is my payment protected?","Your card is authorized when you accept a bid and the money is held safely. The mechanic is paid when the work is done and you release it. YCYC adds a 5% service fee, shown before you confirm.")
B.aXW=new A.lq(B.hj,"Why keep everything on YCYC?","Payment protection, a record of what was agreed, and your privacy safeguards all stop at the edge of the app. If a mechanic asks to take a job outside it, say no \u2014 and tell us.")
